    ideals:["Independence: I am a free spirit. (Chaotic)", "Fairness: I never target people who can't afford to lose. (Lawful)", "Charity: I distribute my earnings to help people. (Good)", "Creativity: I never run the same con twice. (Chaotic)", "Friendship: I swindle only scoundrels. (Good)", "Aspiration: I'm determined to make something of myself. (Any)"],
    bonds:["I fleeced the wrong person and must work to make it up.", "I owe everything to my mentor, a real con artist.", "Somewhere out there I have a child who doesn't know me.", "I come from a noble family and must live up to my name.", "A powerful person killed someone I loved, and revenge is mine.", "I swindled someone who didn't deserve it, and I must make it right."],
    flaws:["I can't resist a pretty face.", "I'm always in debt, spending lavishly to impress.", "I'm convinced I'm the smartest person in any room.", "I'm a terrible liar when caught off guard.", "I get bored easily and move on when things stop being fun.", "I can't resist a long shot."],
