                                              <div style={{fontSize:11,color:"var(--text)",lineHeight:1.5}}>At 14th level, you have mastered the art of weaving spellcasting and weapon use into a single harmonious act. When you use your action to cast a bard spell, you can make one weapon attack as a bonus action.</div>
